        { "visual": "'There is' significa 'Hay' para cosas en singular o incontables: There is a meeting. There is some water.", "audio": "There is means there exists for singular or uncountable things: There is a meeting. There is some water." },
        { "visual": "'There are' significa 'Hay' para cosas en plural: There are two computers. There are many people.", "audio": "There are means there exist for plural things: There are two computers. There are many people." }
